# Nyx.Http — a third-party package with a dependency of its own.
#
# This manifest is what makes the resolver transitive. A toolchain that only read the top-level
# manifest would fetch Nyx.Http and stop; reading *this* file is what brings Nyx.Json into the graph.
#
# The source is a relative path, resolved against this package's own directory — a package's
# dependencies are its own business, and a manifest that named an absolute path would only work on
# the machine that wrote it.

package Nyx.Http
version 2.1.0
dependency Nyx.Json 1.0.0 "../Nyx.Json"
